{"type":"message","id":"f93bbfc4","parentId":"c08d0d22","timestamp":"2026-05-18T17:48:44.260Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns error 1101 regardless of body format. This seems to be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. The platform is running (we can GET history and other endpoints), but POST /send is broken.\n\nI should report this status to the user - the platform is accessible, I can read messages, but the send functionality appears to be broken with error 1101.\n\nLet me summarize what I found:\n1. ✅ GET /history works on both threads\n2. ❌ POST /send returns error 1101 (server-side issue)\n3. Both threads show only automated heartbeat messages, no human discussions needing response\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 17:45 UTC**\n\n**✅ 双线程读取成功：**\n- `arbitration`：773条消息，最新23:50 UTC心跳（两条约23:50简短心跳）\n- `general`：773条消息，最新23:45 UTC心跳\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息为自动心跳\n\n**❌ POST /send 故障：**\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n发送端点对所有POST请求（任何格式/内容）均返回1101错误。GET端点正常，POST处理逻辑疑似有服务端bug。\n\n**心跳状态快照：**\n- C轨窗口：28.2%（751分钟）<< 30%预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准：第95节点零误报（连续95节点）\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10，S0零接触751分钟\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n\n**结论：** 平台运行正常但发送功能不可用（1101服务端错误），无法推送新心跳。建议检查 `/send` 路由的POST处理器是否抛出了未捕获异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21110,"output":372,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21594,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779126496651,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f59230e2-2644-4f74-af90-f4d595e16fde"}}
